{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CATACOMB\u00a0</strong>- is an atmospheric single-player indie psychological horror game. The game is set from a unique body camera like perspective </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average play time is  1 hour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What are the Catacombs?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under  Paris exists kilometers of lost tunnels and rooms\u2014where millions were buried. You are one of the many urban explorers who find themselves lost in this underground world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Can you find your way out alive while a sand monster hunts you down?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate claustrophobic tunnels, crypts and subway systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve occasional puzzles to get out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Jumpscares</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All while a monster haunts and chases you. There is no crafting or inventory aspects\u2014its mostly a psychological horror/atmospheric game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is carefully designed so that you quickly find areas of interest rather than being lost in long tunnels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ray Traced Spatial audio </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic body cam perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first horror game about the Paris Catacombs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All for the price of a sandwich!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452770?t=1761634788","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452770?t=1761634788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452770/2e271433563f914b38ec371236ca7